From 5776444945e63ce7e6185f5fa756438c0f834c4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bengris32 <bengris32@protonmail.ch>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:35:09 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ImsService: Export receivers that aren't exclusively
 registered for system broadcasts

Rebased onto the MT6835 (moto g power 2025 and 2026) ImsService, where one of
these receivers already passes its export flag and the larger handler
method needs the range form of the call.

Signed-off-by: bengris32 <bengris32@protonmail.ch>
Signed-off-by: Sarthak Roy <sarthakroy2002@gmail.com>
Change-Id: Ib6d435028db0d72634056db64aafdc8a2696c182
